# Rootless container stack. Every name below is identical on rpm, deb and
# arch, so no packages.<family>.list override is needed (Ubuntu 26.04.1:
# podman 5.7.0, buildah 1.42.1, skopeo 1.21.0, podman-compose 1.5.0; the same
# four names exist in Arch extra and in the Fedora base repos). Docker is a
# documented non-goal -- see module.sh for the three reasons and for why
# docker group membership is never automated. Curation order is pinned by
# the fixture's exact-batch assert.
podman
buildah
skopeo
podman-compose